{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-interaction-p38150","chapterId":"sfc07235a1e145ae8","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b7be720829103ee96344","text":"是我呀，这样悄无声息地出现，吓到你了吗？","speaker":"大丽花"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-0cc05f650a0add52172d","text":"很惊喜，也很意外。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-ee53574e20d8aa237b5c","text":"你是…大丽花的COSER?","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-d9d2b342f713869113a7","text":"不过，被遗忘的东西也是有温度的，像一场散场舞会之后，曾经紧贴的额头上久久不散的余温…哦！你脸红了，是狸我太近了吗？","speaker":"大丽花"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-5caeb530572bf71667a9","text":"至少此刻，别狸开我的视线，别擅自挣脱属于你我的这份「记忆」喔……","speaker":"大丽花"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-26ea38a6e1e54807e862","text":"很遗憾，我已经识破了。","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-46b2258acfd9081fa235","text":"狸言狸语出卖了你！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-0bb8e9c8f3c66509dbb4","text":"什、什么？我被识破了？","speaker":"大狸花"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-e608bd90f6e6f032e581","text":"你怎么还在背她的台词？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-173cf70489bfdd0b1849","text":"将我，铭心蚀骨吧！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-31b61f94509191e29868","text":"哎呦，下手轻点！","speaker":"大狸花"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-5c770d6d685eacc5508e","text":"战斗胜利","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-833453b75a7f1ae06b19","text":"曲终人亡的时刻…美不胜收。啊啊啊，可惜现在要亡的是我「大狸花」哩！","speaker":"大狸花"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-d704e78453bf26f02cf0","text":"大家才会注意到我，亲热地喊我「老师」，把我簇拥在人群中心啊！","speaker":"大狸花"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-ea453758c42302480b26","text":"你给我回去好好上班！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-bf28e5288b963ce54107","text":"啊啊啊，难怪老板不让我玩cosplay，因为…现在还是上班时间啊！","speaker":"大狸花"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-71d87f6751ffa184e976","text":"你就在星铁FES当演员吧！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-d98f73e051b02f491f6b","text":"啊啊啊，老板您…也为我一比一还原的cosplay而倾倒吗？就知道我的狸猫变化之术堪称天衣无缝，除了老板根本无人能识破哩！","speaker":"大狸花"},{"id":"other-interaction-p38150-b94d653ab1e04bf9f231","text":"祝老板参观愉快！那我就多走动走动，去打卡下一个展览点位了。","speaker":"大狸花"}]}
